# nix-direnv: load the Tinoc flake dev shell automatically when entering
# the repository. Requires direnv + nix-direnv (https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv).
#
#   direnv allow
#
# The shell provides the pinned Go toolchain, golangci-lint, the C11
# toolchain (gcc + clang on Linux, clang on macOS), gdb/valgrind (lldb on
# macOS), and a `tinoc` binary built from the flake package.
use flake
